  "abstract": "Shallow MLP ablation per reviewer: single hidden layer (H=384) with RC and learnable \u03b3[t]. Tests if \u03b3 becomes beneficial when MLP depth is reduced. Adam lr=9e\u22124, clip=1.0, dr=0.10, curvature \u03bb=1e\u22124, 60\u2011min trials.",
